    "slug": "mark-zuckerberg-envisions-a-future-with-personal-ai-agents-f",
    "dek": "As Meta invests heavily in AI, the tech leader anticipates that personal AI agents will become ubiquitous within five years. Investors remain skeptical about the potential returns.",
