    "slug": "netflix-to-release-lea-seydoux-s-gentle-monster-this-fall",
    "dek": "Léa Seydoux's Cannes drama, directed by Marie Kreutzer, opens in select U.S. theaters October 30 and arrives on Netflix November 18.",
