    "slug": "ariana-grande-steps-back-from-public-life-following-tour-and",
    "dek": "Amid growing public scrutiny, Ariana Grande announces an extended break from visibility as she wraps up her tour and withdraws from an upcoming musical.",
    "trending": false,
